This document proposes a research direction and a testable architecture. It does not establish that the Merkle Object Layer is an approved Project #5 subsystem, that any particular hash or encoding has been selected, or that the proposed interfaces are normative.

Promotion to an implementation specification requires review against the authoritative Project #5 master specification, resolution of the relevant open decisions, and explicit project-owner approval.

